        "tag": "title",
        "text": "26"
      },
      {
        "y": 24.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 375.3,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "Travel and accommodation"
      },
      {
        "y": 70.7,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 253.9,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Booking travel and holidays"
      },
      {
        "y": 88.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 256.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Here are some choices you may make"
      },
      {
        "y": 97.6,
        "x0": 285.6,
        "x1": 427.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "first, business or economy class"
      },
      {
        "y": 100.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 236.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "when booking travel or holidays."
      },
      {
        "y": 112.4,
        "x0": 285.6,
        "x1": 428.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "route (e.g. via /vaɪə/ Amsterdam)"
      },
      {
        "y": 127.2,
        "x0": 189.9,
        "x1": 452.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "scheduled airline (e.g. low-cost/budget such as"
      },
      {
        "y": 139.2,
        "x0": 189.9,
        "x1": 484.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "flight easyJet or national carrier such as Emirates)"
      },
      {
        "y": 158.2,
        "x0": 109.9,
        "x1": 133.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "By air"
      },
      {
        "y": 174,
        "x0": 189.9,
        "x1": 421.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "charter package/all-inclusive holiday"
      },
      {
        "y": 187.3,
        "x0": 189.9,
        "x1": 330.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "flight flight only"
      },
      {
        "y": 203.7,
        "x0": 285.6,
        "x1": 444.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "extras (e.g. airport taxes, insurance)"
      },
      {
        "y": 233.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 409.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A scheduled flight is a normal, regular flight; a charter flight is a special flight"
      },
      {
        "y": 245.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 410.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "taking a group of people, usually to the same holiday destination. Some airline"
      },
      {
        "y": 257.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 429.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "tickets may have restrictions (e.g. you can only travel on certain days). Such tickets"
      },
      {
        "y": 268.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 412.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "can offer good value for money but, if you cancel, they are non-refundable1or"
      },
      {
        "y": 280.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 395,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "you may have to pay a cancellation fee. Some tickets allow a stopover2. A"
      },
      {
        "y": 293.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 425.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "package holiday normally includes accommodation and transfers, e.g. a coach or"
      },
      {
        "y": 305.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 423.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "a shuttle bus to and from your hotel. An all-inclusive holiday includes your flight,"
      },
      {
        "y": 317.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 344.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "accommodation and all meals, drinks and snacks in the hotel."
      },
      {
        "y": 335.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 515.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 you can’t get your money back 2 you may stay somewhere overnight before continuing to your destination"
      },
      {
        "y": 349.9,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 509,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Sea travel is normally on a ferry, and the journey is called a crossing, but you"
      },
      {
        "y": 361.9,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 509.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "can have a holiday on the sea if you go on a cruise. For some people, a luxury"
      },
      {
        "y": 373,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 517.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "cruise is the holiday of a lifetime1. You may decide to book a berth in a shared"
      },
      {
        "y": 385,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 511.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "cabin2, or to have a single or double cabin. For more money, you can often get"
      },
      {
        "y": 397,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 516.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "a deluxe cabin, perhaps on the upper deck3. Cruises often go to exotic4 islands"
      },
      {
        "y": 409,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 339.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "where you can get away from it all5."
      },
      {
        "y": 428,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 464,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 one you will always remember 2 a bed in a cabin with other people 3 the higher part of the ship,"
      },
      {
        "y": 440,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 479.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "which is often bigger and more comfortable 4 unusual or exciting 5 escape your daily life and routines"
      },
      {
        "y": 456.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 386.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Train travel allows you to relax as you travel and look at the countryside"
      },
      {
        "y": 468.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 413.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "through the windows of your carriage. Railways link major towns but you may"
      },
      {
        "y": 479.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 363,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "have to change trains1 if you are not able to get a through train2."
      },
      {
        "y": 499.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 388.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 get off one train and on to another 2 or direct train, one which takes you"
      },
      {
        "y": 512.3,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 201.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "directly to your destination"
      },
      {
        "y": 527.9,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 514.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Car hire is another way of getting around1. When you book it, you may have to"
      },
      {
        "y": 539.9,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 519.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "choose whether you want unlimited mileage2. There may also be extras to pay,"
      },
      {
        "y": 552.8,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 507.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "such as accident insurance. If you hire a car, it gives you the freedom to come"
      },
      {
        "y": 563.9,
        "x0": 184.3,
        "x1": 281.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and go as you please3."
      },
      {
        "y": 584,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 480.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 travelling to different places; informal 2 /ˈmaɪlɪdʒ/ you can travel as many miles as you like for the"
      },
      {
        "y": 596,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 290,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "same price 3 go where you want when you want"
      },
      {
        "y": 614.1,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 278.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Accommodation when travelling"
      },
      {
        "y": 630.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 500,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some people like camping1 while others prefer hotels. Or you can have a self-catering2 holiday,"
      },
      {
        "y": 642.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 518.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "such as staying in an apartment or chalet3. You can also choose to stay in a guest house4 or an inn5."
      },
      {
        "y": 654.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 364.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some types of accommodation offer half board6 or full board7."
      },
      {
        "y": 675,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 518.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 sleeping in a tent or a caravan 2 where you do your own cooking 3 /ˈʃæleɪ/ small cottage or cabin specially"
      },
      {
        "y": 687,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 518.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "built for holiday-makers 4 small, relatively cheap hotel 5 similar to a pub, but also offering accommodation;"
      },
      {
        "y": 699,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 453.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "sometimes in an attractive old building 6 usually breakfast and one other meal 7 all meals"
      }
    ],
