        "tag": "main",
        "text": "26.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 436.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Use vocabulary from A opposite to express these sentences more briefly."
      },
      {
        "y": 88,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 353.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 It was a regular flight which the airline runs every day."
      },
      {
        "y": 100.9,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 206.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "It was a scheduled flight."
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 486.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 I hate those special flights where everyone is booked to the same holiday destination."
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 506.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 The ticket allowed us to spend up to three nights in Singapore on the journey from London"
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 171.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "to Sydney."
      },
      {
        "y": 148,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 410.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 You can get a bed on the ferry in a little room with three other beds."
      },
      {
        "y": 160,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 415.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Our seats were in the part of the train that was nearest to the engine."
      },
      {
        "y": 172,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 400.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 The bus or taxi to your hotel is included in the cost of the holiday."
      },
      {
        "y": 184,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 443.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 It was a cheap fare, but there were some things you were not allowed to do."
      },
      {
        "y": 196,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 486.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 The ticket is relatively cheap, but you can’t get your money back if you have to cancel."
      },
      {
        "y": 208,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 448.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 The price of the holiday includes the flight, hotel and all your food and drink."
      },
      {
        "y": 224.3,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
