      },
      {
        "y": 370.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 493.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Which expressions in the box do you associate with each of the holidays below? Use a"
      },
      {
        "y": 382.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 487.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "dictionary if necessary. Each expression may go with more than one type of holiday."
      },
      {
        "y": 402.9,
        "x0": 122.1,
        "x1": 456,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "to rough it to keep on the move to just drift along"
      },
      {
        "y": 419.2,
