        "text": "to be out in the wilds a real learning experience to come and go as you please"
      },
      {
        "y": 451.7,
        "x0": 122.1,
        "x1": 532.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "to lounge around to be your own boss to spend a fortune on entrance fees"
